{"step_index":129,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T15:48:16Z","content":"最新兩項優化已完成，且已成功同步部署上線！🎉\n\n您可以點擊下方連結立即預覽全新版本的網頁：\n\n👉 **[https://jetbrains-ai-assistant-portal.web.app](https://jetbrains-ai-assistant-portal.web.app)**  \n*(防快取備用連結：[dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html](file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html))*\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ 本次優化升級亮點：\n\n1. **電腦版字體全面放大與升級 (Desktop Font Scaling)**：\n   * 標題、內文、比較表格、清單與按鈕文字在電腦大螢幕上全面放大，閱讀體驗更舒適、排版呼吸感更足。\n2. **快捷按鈕「二階段開關 (Toggle Switch)」效果**：\n   * **點擊第 1 次**：自動滑動至該區段並**展開說明**。\n   * **再次點擊第 2 次**：自動將該區段**收合 / 摺疊起來**，達成完美的 Toggle 開關效果！\n3. **Firebase Hosting 無縫更新**：\n   * 最新版本已秒級同步至 Firebase，可直接發送給客戶進行即時簡報與介紹！\n\n---\n\n<agent-embed src=\"file:///C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html\"></agent-embed>\n\n---\n\n祝您明天對客戶的 Pitch 簡報一切順利！如果還有任何想要調整的細節，隨時告訴我！"}
{"step_index":130,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T15:52:50Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\n另外幾點優化：\n１．＂簡報大綱快捷目錄 (點擊自動引導/展開，再次點擊即可收起＂這一段提示應該字體要大．並且高亮特效\n２．最上面的＂快捷按鈕.我想要做在畫面的右邊．客戶可以循序漸進的從１點到６．做成浮動按鈕．點下去後一樣會導航到該區塊展開閱讀\n３．幫我將附件＂LOGO 白\"的圖片放在最上列的左邊\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-08-31T23:52:50+08:00.\n\nThe user has uploaded 2 image(s):\n- C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/.user_uploaded/media_1788191441655.png\n- C:/Users/User/.gemini/antigravity/brain/cebfe850-edaa-4bde-aa18-447bd515eeb1/.user_uploaded/media_1788191541973.png\nYou can embed these images in an artifact if you need the USER to review them.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
